# Saved copies of third-party pages from the external source check (~28 MB).
# The audit trail does not depend on them: source_page_manifest.json and
# timeline_page_manifest.json record every URL with its SHA-256, and
# combined_results.json / kill_timeline_results.json hold the field-by-field
# comparison those pages were read for.
audit/source_check_2026-10-20/*.html

# R session leftovers
.Rhistory
.RData
.Rapp.history
.Rproj.user/
Rplots.pdf

# Operating system noise
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store
